# Only the postgres build (context: repo root, for Dockerfile.postgres to
# reach every service's schema*.sql) uses this - keeps that build context
# small instead of sending every service's .venv/node_modules to the daemon.
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.git
**/.vs
logs
UPDATED AGENTS
